    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1627">

                <pb facs="1020" n="904" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg904"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811.0144/20.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Chargé O’Shaughnessy.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1501.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 12, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I enclose herewith a copy of a despatch
                    from the Consul at Nuevo Laredo, in regard to the kidnapping of Samuel Cantu on
                    American territory by Mexican federal officers. You will bring to the attention
                    of the appropriate authorities the abuses committed by the military leaders in
                    Nuevo Laredo and request that immediate action be taken to put a stop
                    thereto.</p>
                <p>You will add that the lawless disposition of the commander at Nuevo Laredo, as
                    shown by his disregard of international rights and obligations, appears to
                    suggest the propriety of his removal from his present position of command
                    adjacent to the borders of the United States, where his acts have already tended
                    to create grave international complications.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. B. Moore</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
